   "body": "Fixed in 03f609e3f (v0.1.2339): decimal digits the local model calls a secret are masked only when the name right before them ends in a key/token/password/PIN word; <total_tokens>N tokens left</total_tokens>, \"total_tokens\": N, max_tokens: N go as written. The eval's token-count case passes for AstrLink Guard now.",
